sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor DS as Data Scientist
    participant WB as OpenShift AI Workbench
    participant PVC as Shared PVC
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Feast as Feast Server
    participant Ray as KubeRay
    participant Trainer as Kubeflow Trainer
    participant MLflow as RHOAI MLflow
    participant KServe as KServe

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over DS,PG: Notebook 01 — real Walmart competition data
        DS->>WB: Upload train/test/features/stores CSV files
        WB->>WB: Validate, join, create prior-only features with pandas
        WB->>PVC: Write Parquet sources
        WB->>Feast: feast apply + materialize
        Feast->>PG: Registry + online feature writes
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over DS,MLflow: Notebook 02 — training and evaluation
        DS->>WB: Run rolling-origin evaluation and submit TrainJob
        WB->>Trainer: Submit unique TrainJob name
        Trainer->>Feast: get_historical_features(training_features)
        Feast->>Ray: Point-in-time joins (optional plugin path)
        Ray-->>Feast: Historical rows
        Feast-->>Trainer: Bounded result for rank-0 pandas preparation
        Trainer->>PVC: Save model, metrics, report in unique run directory
        Trainer-->>WB: Complete
        WB->>MLflow: Log metrics/artifacts with Workbench integration
        Note over WB,Trainer: Workbench OAuth token is not forwarded to the Trainer pod
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over DS,KServe: Notebook 03 — internal inference
        DS->>WB: Deploy candidate from latest_candidate.json
        WB->>KServe: Create InferenceService
        KServe->>PVC: Load model and scalers
        DS->>KServe: V2 request with Store/Dept and forecast origin
        KServe->>Feast: get_online_features()
        Feast->>PG: Read online feature vector
        PG-->>Feast: Prior-only features
        Feast-->>KServe: Feature vector
        KServe-->>DS: Forecast for target week
    end
